PATCH 161: thread the model-loader callers (19d1 batch-.MAL / 1a45 streaming-.Mxx) so the FILEMGR
cluster (patch 160) receives the load segment + filename + read args.

The 3D-model LOD loader FUN_0000_1631 -> 18dc -> 183f dispatches two file paths, both of which reach the
seg-0f69 FILEMGR through DGROUP method vectors but dropped the ES(load-seg)/DX(filename)/CX/DX(read) regs
at the __allregs indirect-call sites (Ghidra base-loss):
  - FUN_0000_19d1 (.MAL palette/aux): allocs 0x400 para via [0xe4] into DGROUP:[0x26e4+idx*2], sets
    ES=that seg, then `mov bx,0x740; lcall [0x384]` = 2733 batch-LOAD.  Threaded: publish the alloc
    segment in DAT_1000_2b5e (the ES:0 read target 2593 reads, patch 101 convention) + pass DX=filename
    0x740 to 2733.
  - FUN_0000_1a45 (.Mxx LOD): `mov dx,0x740; lcall [0x38c]` = 276e streaming-OPEN, then
    `mov bx,slot; mov cx,0x10; mov dx,0x267c; lcall [0x394]` = 27f7 READ of the 16-byte model header.
    Threaded: DX=0x740 to the open, (slot=DAT_1000_e67a, cx=0x10, dx=0x267c) to the read.
All asm-verified vs re_out/fist_dat_image.bin (0x19d1..0x1a24, 0x1a45..).

EMPIRICALLY DRIVEN (throwaway ACCEPT-cascade wiring, not committed): with 160+161 the mission cascade
runs BATTLES->OK->ACCEPT through the FSG parse into the model loader and issues REAL INT-21h opens in the
DOSBox order -- FLDCOMP.MRL -> LOADING.MS3 -> LOADING.MRL -> AZER1.FSG(SHDR read) -> the 3D-model loader
(FILEMGR open on DGROUP:0x740).  BEHAVIOUR-NEUTRAL for the 19 verify flows (model loader is
ACCEPT-cascade-only): re_out/fist.c pristine 61453e42; tools/verify.sh both = 19/19.
